Before our meeting with Mak, my team and I talked about the sketches and wireframes we made for the prototype.
Each of us had a task to do our own version to show for today’s class. 
We then looked at all of them and tried to combine our best ideas into one design. 
It was nice to see how different our thoughts were, and we learned a lot from each other.
After we agreed on the main design, we divided the tasks for our homework. 
Each person got a part to work on, so everyone knew what to do. 

Then we had our meeting with Mak. She checked in on us and asked how we were doing as a team.
